# Web SEO: Programmatic SEO (pSEO)

Programmatic routes ship **catalog constants** on the server, **SSR meta + JSON-LD** in `+page.server.ts`, and **templates** in `+page.svelte`. Section wiring and component order: **web-seo-pseo-templates**. SSR meta, canonical, and JSON-LD mechanics: **web-seo-meta-tags**, **web-seo-canonical**, **web-seo-jsonld**.

Landing (`/`) and pricing FAQ copy from secret-admin config: **web-seo-cms-copy** (same `faqLink` helpers; channel connect funnel rules below apply to pSEO catalogs only).

## Three-layer contract

| Layer | Location | Responsibility |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Constants** | `$lib/content/constants/**`, `$lib/**/constants/public*Config.ts`, `$lib/**/constants/public*FaqConfig.ts` | Hero, features, FAQ Q&A, meta strings, tool/channel recipes |
| **Server load** | `+page.server.ts` | `createMetaData`, `buildCanonicalUrl`, `schemaData` (`createPublicFaqSEOSchema`, domain builders), VMs from presenters |
| **Template** | `+page.svelte` | `$derived(data.*)`; `<JsonLdHead schemaData={…} />`; `<PublicFaq … />`; no inline JSON-LD |

Forward `pageMetaTags` and `schemaData` through universal `+page.ts` on client nav (**web-sveltekit-universal-page-load**).

